WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.460
Night falls on Gethsemane, a
garden on the Mount of Olives.

2
00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:08.460
Hours earlier, Peter promised:
If I must die with you,

3
00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:10.530
I will not deny you.

4
00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:12.890
Now Jesus is arrested.

5
00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:15.230
Two people are questioned
in the same house,

6
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.990
at the same time.

7
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:20.140
Upstairs, the high priest questions Jesus.

8
00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:24.270
Below, by a fire, a servant
girl questions Peter.

9
00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:27.710
Why does Mark tell these
two scenes side by side?

10
00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:32.020
In this mission, you'll follow the
night from the garden to two trials.

11
00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:36.310
Then you'll weigh up whether a disciple
who fails can be a better example than

12
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:37.720
a loyal one.

13
00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:42.110
Your mission: find out what Mark
wants readers to see in this night.
